  "Notes": "Fabricated spacerless filter (ZnS/MgF2, Ag 600 A) corresponding to the Fig. 10/11 design\nSpecification: Silver band-pass near 546 nm with low background\nReported: Measured (Fig. 16): half-width 40 nm, peak T 63 %, Tmin = 1.2 % near 480 nm (plot label), T < 0.1 % toward 760-800 nm.\nNotes: Same caveats as the Fig. 15 filter; the paper does not say whether the 0.7H error was corrected in the fabricated filter.\nLayers from Fig. 16 caption; text p. 239; layer 1 faces the incident medium.\nNot checked: the paper reports this design only as plots.",
